EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Have you seen all the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}feathers{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
floating around today?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0016:}}You can
