!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Frohen {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Karneval{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Der Tag ist noch jung.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Du hast
also viel Zeit für die Feierlichkeiten.

{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ich möchte endlich feiern gehen!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Aber ich bin noch unschlüssig, was
mein Outfit angeht{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Eğlenceye katılmak istiyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ama ne giyeceğimi bilmiyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
Bunu söyleyeceğimi hiç
sanmazdım, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ama fazla kıyafetim var. {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Dur-{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
geri aldım!

